   "sig": "static int pca9554_identify(unsigned addr)",
   "doc": "Reads only. Returns 1 if each of registers 0..3 gives the same byte twice in a 2-byte read, registers 4..7 read the same as 0..3, and the four are not all one value. Returns 0 if any check fails (a part that reads the same value everywhere, such as 0xFF, is not taken as this part). Returns a negative bus error if a read fails. The part has no ID register.",
   "access": "read",
   "write_regs": [],
   "max_write": 1,
   "policy": "allow"
  }
 ],
